        "text": "Page: The Reels. Sentence: The Reels had top-10 Australian Kent Music Report Singles Chart success with covers of Herb Alpert's \"This Guy's in Love With You\" (No. 7, 1982) and Creedence Clearwater Revival's \"Bad Moon Rising\" (No. 11, 1986).\nPage: Creedence Clearwater Revival. Sentence: Creedence Clearwater Revival, often informally abbreviated to Creedence or CCR, was an American rock band active in the late 1960s and early 1970s.\nPage: After the News. Sentence: \"After the News\" was a song by The Reels that was released as a single from their second album \"Quasimodo's Dream\" in July 1980.",
